        <profile name="Prey of the Blood God" id="b3a4-1138-6b4f-3a39" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your first Command phase, select one enemy CHARACTER unit. Each time this model makes an attack against that CHARACTER unit, a successful wound roll inflicts 2 mortal wounds on the target and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Pack Leader (Aura)" id="cd0b-dde3-3166-6df7" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly FLESH HOUNDS CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a wound roll of 1. If the target is a PSYKER unit, you can re-roll the wound roll instead.</characteristic>
