            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly BLOODLETTERS CORE unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack&apos;s hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
