          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Fight phase, you can select one enemy model that is within Engagement Range of this model and roll one D6; if the result is higher than that model&apos;s Wounds characteristic, that model is destroyed.</characteristic>
