          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this WARLORD loses a wound as a result of a melee attack made by an enemy unit, after the attacking model&apos;s unit has finished making its attacks, roll one D6. On a 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. Each unit can only suffer a maximum of 6 mortal wounds per phase as a result of this ability.</characteristic>
