        <profile name="Keep Counting! Meet your Quota!" id="16dc-705d-a65b-b52b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly PLAGUEBEARERS CORE unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase:
- Each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to that attack&apos;s hit roll.
- That unit has the Objective Secured ability. If that unit already has the Objective Secured ability, then for the purposes of determining which player controls an objective marker, each model in that unit counts as 2 models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
