        <profile name="Ritual Slaughter (Action)" id="5875-c673-a6bb-cb29" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While there is a model embarked within this TRANSPORT model, this TRANSPORT model may attempt the following action:

At the end of your Movement phase, this model can start to perform this action. The action is ocmpleted at the end of your next Charge phase. Once completed, roll one D6 for each LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE unit from your army within 12&quot; of this model and within Engagement Range of any enemy units: for each 4+, you gain 1 Warp Storm point.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
