          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit is eligible to perform a Heroic Intevention if it is within 6&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically of any CHARACTER units, instead of 3&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically. Each time this unit performs a Heroic Intervention move, it can move up to 6&quot; if it finishes that move within Engagement Range of an enemy CHARACTER unit. All other rules for Heroic Interventions still apply.</characteristic>
