          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA or DISCIPLES OF BE&apos;LAKOR unit (excluding VEHICLE units) is within 6&quot; of this model, each ime a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Spiteful Jealousy" id="57c3-9927-a215-def8" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged, you cannot include this model in a Detachment that includes any other DAEMON PRINCE models. Each time this model makes an attack that targets a DAEMON PRINCE model, you can re-roll the hit roll and you can re-roll the wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
