                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing. If manifested, select one friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE CORE unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of melee weapons models in that unit are equipped with.</characteristic>
