                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this WARLORD successfully manifests a psychic power from the Pandaemoniac discipline, add 6&quot; to the range of that psychic power. If that psychic power specifies more than one range, only add 6&quot; to the first range specified.</characteristic>
