              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of each battle round, if the bearer destroyed any enemy models during that battle round, you can retain up to 2 unspent Warp Storm points.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
