                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to the bearer&apos;s Attacks characteristic.
- Each time the bearer makes a melee attack that destroys a CHARACTER, MONSTER or VEHICLE unit, add 1 to the bearer&apos;s Attacks characteristic.</characteristic>
