                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">TZEENTCH model only. Each time the bearer attempts to manifest a Witchfire psychic power or Smite, on an unmodified Psychic test of 9 or more, if that power is not denied, after resolving the effects of that psychic power, you can resolve the effects of that psychic power again</characteristic>
