                            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">-3</characteristic>
                            <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">3</characteristic>
                            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon, an unmodified wound roll of 6 innicts D3 mortal wounds on the target in addition to any normal damage. If any model is destroyed by these mortal wounds, that model&apos;s unit suffers a further D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
