                        <profile name="Tears of Asuryan" id="0eb8-4700-6062-f5df" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">SLAAN ESH model only. Once per battle, in your Command phase, 
the bearer can shatter a Tear of Asuryan. When they do so: 
, You gain 6 Warp Storm points (pg 58). 
, Until the start of your next Command phase, the bearer 
knows all the psychic powers from the Soulstain discipline.</characteristic>
